-Icon auf iPhone und iPad. Die Mac-App behält ihr eigenes Icon."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Modifie l'icône de stashy sur iPhone et iPad. L'app Mac garde sa propre icône."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Altera o ícone do app stashy no iPhone e no iPad. O app para Mac mantém seu próprio ícone."}}}},"hint_changes_stashy_app_icon_to":{"localizations":{"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ændrer stashys appikon til den farve, du vælger."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Endrer stashy-appikonet til fargen du velger."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashyのAppアイコンを選んだ色に変更します。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ändert das stashy-App-Icon in die gewählte Farbe."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Cambia el icono de stashy al color que elijas."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Changes the stashy app icon to the color you pick."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wijzigt het stashy-appsymbool naar de kleur die je kiest."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy 앱 아이콘을 선택한 색상으로 변경합니다."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Altera o ícone do app stashy para a cor escolhida."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Donne à l'icône de stashy la couleur choisie."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zmienia ikonę aplikacji stashy na wybrany kolor."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Cambia l'icona dell'app stashy nel colore che scegli."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Меняет цвет значка stashy на выбранный."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"將 stashy App 圖像更改為你選擇的顏色。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"将 stashy App 图标更改为你选择的颜色。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ändrar stashys appsymbol till den färg du väljer."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy uygulama simgesini seçtiğin renge değiştirir."}}}},"hint_choose_appearance_of_app":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"选择 App 的外观。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Uygulamanın görünümünü seç."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Välj appens utseende."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"選擇 App 的外觀。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Choose the appearance of the app."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elige la apariencia de la app."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scegli l'aspetto dell'app."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Choisissez l'apparence de l'app."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vælg appens udseende."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wähle die Darstellung der App."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"앱의 화면 모드를 선택하세요."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Escolha a aparência do app."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Velg utseendet til appen."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Выберите оформление приложения."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Appの外観を選択します。"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wybierz wygląd aplikacji."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kies de weergave van de app."}}}},"hint_choose_rows_on_home_and":{"localizations":{"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"홈에 표시할 행과 순서를 선택하세요. 행을 선택하면 표시하거나 가리거나 위아래로 이동할 수 있습니다. 서버마다 설정이 따로 저장됩니다."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Velg radene på Hjem og rekkefølgen deres. Velg en rad for å vise eller skjule den, eller flytte den opp eller ned. Hver server har sitt eget oppsett."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Escolha as linhas do Início e sua ordem. Selecione uma linha para mostrá-la ou ocultá-la, ou para movê-la para cima ou para baixo. Cada servidor mantém sua própria configuração."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ホームに表示する行とその順序を選択します。行を選択すると、表示・非表示の切り替えや上下への移動ができます。設定はサーバーごとに保存されます。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Choisissez les rangées de l'accueil et leur ordre. Sélectionnez une rangée pour l'afficher, la masquer ou la déplacer vers le haut ou le bas. Chaque serveur garde sa propre configuration."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kies de rijen op Home en hun volgorde. Selecteer een rij om hem te tonen of te verbergen, of om hem omhoog of omlaag te verplaatsen. Elke server heeft zijn eigen indeling."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Выберите ряды главной и их порядок. Выберите ряд, чтобы показать или скрыть его либо переместить вверх или вниз. Для каждого сервера настройка своя."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wähle die Zeilen auf Start und ihre Reihenfolge. Wähle eine Zeile, um sie ein- oder auszublenden oder nach oben oder unten zu verschieben. Jeder Server hat seine eigene Einrichtung."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elige las filas de Inicio y su orden. Selecciona una fila para mostrarla u ocultarla, o para subirla o bajarla. Cada servidor guarda su propia configuración."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vælg rækkerne på Hjem og deres rækkefølge. Vælg en række for at vise eller skjule den eller flytte den op eller ned. Hver server har sin egen opsætning."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wybierz wiersze na ekranie Start i ich kolejność. Wybierz wiersz, aby go pokazać lub ukryć albo przesunąć w górę lub w dół. Każdy serwer ma własny układ."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scegli le righe della Home e il loro ordine. Seleziona una riga per mostrarla o nasconderla, o per spostarla su o giù. Ogni server ha la sua configurazione."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Choose the rows on Home and their order. Select a row to show or hide it, or to move it up or down. Each server keeps its own setup."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"選擇首頁上的列及其順序。選取一列即可顯示或隱藏，或將其上移或下移。每個伺服器都會保留自己的設定。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"选择主页上的行及其顺序。选择一行可显示或隐藏它，或将其上移或下移。每个服务器都有各自的设置。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Välj raderna på Hem och deras ordning. Välj en rad för att visa eller dölja den eller flytta den upp eller ned. Varje server har sin egen uppsättning."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ana Sayfa'daki satırları ve sıralarını seç. Göstermek, gizlemek veya yukarı ya da aşağı taşımak için bir satır seç. Her sunucu kendi düzenini korur."}}}},"hint_chooses_saved_filter_or_preset":{"localizations":{"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kayıtlı bir filtre veya hazır ayar seçer"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Väljer ett sparat filter eller en förinställning"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"選擇已儲存的篩選條件或預設組合"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"选择已存过滤器或预设"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kiest een bewaard filter of voorinstelling"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wybiera zapisany filtr lub ustawienie wstępne"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Chooses a saved filter or preset"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vælger et gemt filter eller en forudindstilling"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sceglie un filtro salvato o un preset"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wählt einen gespeicherten Filter oder ein Preset"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Choisit un filtre enregistré ou un préréglage"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Выбор сохраненного фильтра или шаблона"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Escolhe um filtro salvo ou predefinição"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"저장된 필터 또는 프리셋을 선택합니다"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elige un filtro guardado o un preajuste"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"保存済みフィルターまたはプリセットを選択します"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Velger et lagret filter eller en forhåndsinnstilling"}}}},"hint_chooses_which_feed_mode_to":{"localizations":{"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Escolhe qual modo de feed mostrar"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elige qué modo de feed mostrar"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"표시할 피드 모드를 선택합니다"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sceglie quale modalità del feed mostrare"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kiest welke feedmodus wordt getoond"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Choisit le mode de flux à afficher"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Velger hvilken feed-modus som vises"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Выбор режима ленты"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vælger, hvilken feed-tilstand der vises"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wählt, welcher Feed-Modus angezeigt wird"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"表示するフィードモードを選択します"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wybiera, który tryb Feed pokazać"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Chooses which feed mode to show"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Väljer vilket flödesläge som visas"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"選擇要顯示的 Feed 模式"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"选择要显示的信息流模式"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Gösterilecek akış modunu seçer"}}}},"h