n i taget. ▲ ▼ bläddra, ◀ ▶ spola, klicka för info och lägen."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"全屏，依次播放。▲ ▼ 浏览，◀ ▶ 跳转，按下查看信息和模式。"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"A pantalla completa, uno tras otro. ▲ ▼ explorar, ◀ ▶ buscar, clic para info y modos."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Full-screen, one after another. ▲ ▼ browse, ◀ ▶ seek, click for info and modes."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"A schermo intero, uno dopo l'altro. ▲ ▼ sfoglia, ◀ ▶ cerca, clic per info e modalità."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"全画面で1つずつ表示。▲ ▼ で切り替え、◀ ▶ でシーク、クリックで情報とモード。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Schermvullend, de een na de ander. ▲ ▼ blader, ◀ ▶ zoek, klik voor info en modi."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fuld skærm, én efter én. ▲ ▼ gennemse, ◀ ▶ spol, klik for info og tilstande."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Na pełnym ekranie, jedna po drugiej. ▲ ▼ przeglądaj, ◀ ▶ przewijaj, kliknij, aby zobaczyć informacje i tryby."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Em tela cheia, um após o outro. ▲ ▼ navegar, ◀ ▶ buscar, clique para informações e modos."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fullskjerm, én etter én. ▲ ▼ bla, ◀ ▶ spol, klikk for info og moduser."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Во весь экран, одна за другой. ▲ ▼ — просмотр, ◀ ▶ — перемотка, нажатие — сведения и режимы."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"En plein écran, l'un après l'autre. ▲ ▼ parcourir, ◀ ▶ avancer/reculer, clic pour les infos et les modes."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vollbild, eins nach dem anderen. ▲ ▼ blättern, ◀ ▶ spulen, Klick für Infos und Modi."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"전체 화면으로 하나씩 표시합니다. ▲ ▼ 탐색, ◀ ▶ 탐색 이동, 클릭하여 정보 및 모드 보기."}}}},"hint_generate_heatmaps_and_speeds_for":{"localizations":{"