onda, por ejemplo en tu red doméstica. Si no, se vuelve a la otra automáticamente."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"任意。応答がある場合（自宅のネットワークなど）は、上のアドレスの代わりに使用されます。自動的に切り替わります。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Facultatif. Utilisée à la place de l'adresse ci-dessus dès qu'elle répond, par exemple sur votre réseau domestique. Bascule automatiquement sinon."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"선택 사항. 홈 네트워크 등에서 응답할 때마다 위의 주소 대신 사용됩니다. 응답하지 않으면 자동으로 되돌아갑니다."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Valgfritt. Brukes i stedet for adressen ovenfor når den svarer, for eksempel på hjemmenettverket. Faller automatisk tilbake."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Optioneel. Wordt gebruikt in plaats van het adres hierboven zodra het antwoordt, bijvoorbeeld op je thuisnetwerk. Valt automatisch terug."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Необязательно. Используется вместо адреса выше, когда отвечает, например в домашней сети. При недоступности — автоматический возврат."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Facoltativo. Usato al posto dell'indirizzo qui sopra ogni volta che risponde, ad esempio sulla rete di casa. Altrimenti torna automaticamente all'altro."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Valgfri. Bruges i stedet for adressen ovenfor, når den svarer, f.eks. på dit hjemmenetværk. Skifter automatisk tilbage."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"İsteğe bağlı. Yanıt verdiği sürece, örneğin ev ağında, yukarıdaki adres yerine kullanılır. Otomatik olarak geri döner."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"可选。只要该地址有响应（例如在家庭网络中），就会代替上方地址使用。会自动回退。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"選填。只要能連上，就會取代上方的位址，例如在你的家用網路中。連不上時會自動改用原位址。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Valfritt. Används i stället för adressen ovan när den svarar, till exempel på ditt hemnätverk. Faller tillbaka automatiskt."}}}},"hint_original_could_not_be_played":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"无法播放原始文件 — 正在使用服务器转码"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"無法播放原始檔 — 改用伺服器轉檔"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Orijinal oynatılamadı — sunucu dönüştürmesi kullanılıyor"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Originalen kunne ikke spilles av – bruker serverens transkoding"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Не удалось воспроизвести оригинал — используется перекодировка сервера"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"No se pudo reproducir el original; se usa la transcodificación del servidor"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Originalen kunne ikke afspilles – bruger serverens omkodning"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"オリジナルを再生できませんでした — サーバーのトランスコードを使用します"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Original could not be played — using the server transcode"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Não foi possível reproduzir o original — usando a transcodificação do servidor"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Origineel kon niet worden afgespeeld – de servertranscode wordt gebruikt"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Original konnte nicht abgespielt werden – Server-Transcode wird verwendet"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Originalet kunde inte spelas – använder serverns omkodning"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"L'original n'a pas pu être lu — utilisation du transcodage du serveur"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Impossibile riprodurre l'originale: uso della transcodifica del server"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nie można odtworzyć oryginału — używane jest transkodowanie serwera"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"원본을 재생할 수 없습니다 — 서버 트랜스코드를 사용합니다"}}}},"hint_other_names_for_this_tag":{"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Andere Namen für diesen Tag. Nach links wischen, um einen zu entfernen."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Andre navn på denne taggen. Sveip til venstre for å fjerne ett."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Другие названия этого тега. Смахните влево, чтобы удалить."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Other names for this tag. Swipe left to remove one."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Andre navne for dette tag. Stryg til venstre for at fjerne et."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Outros nomes para esta etiqueta. Deslize para a esquerda para remover um."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Inne nazwy tego tagu. Przesuń w lewo, aby usunąć."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Otros nombres de esta etiqueta. Desliza a la izquierda para quitar uno."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"このタグの別名です。左にスワイプして削除します。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 태그의 다른 이름입니다. 제거하려면 왼쪽으로 쓸어넘기세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Autres noms de cette étiquette. Balayez vers la gauche pour en retirer un."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Andere namen voor dit label. Veeg naar links om er een te verwijderen."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Altri nomi per questo tag. Scorri a sinistra per rimuoverne uno."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bu etiketin diğer adları. Birini kaldırmak için sola kaydır."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Andra namn på taggen. Svep åt vänster för att ta bort ett."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此标签的其他名称。向左轻扫可移除。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"此標籤的其他名稱。向左滑動即可移除。"}}}},"hint_payment_is_charged_to_your":{"localizations":{"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"款項將從你的 Apple ID 扣款。除非在期間結束前至少 24 小時取消，否則訂閱會自動續訂。你可隨時在 App Store 設定中管理或取消。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"费用将从你的 Apple 账户扣除。除非在当前周期结束前至少 24 小时取消，否则订阅将自动续订。可随时在 App Store 设置中管理或取消。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ödeme Apple Kimliğin'den alınır. Abonelikler, dönem bitmeden en az 24 saat önce iptal edilmezse otomatik olarak yenilenir. App Store ayarlarından istediğin zaman yönet veya iptal et."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Betalningen debiteras ditt Apple-ID. Prenumerationer förnyas automatiskt om de inte avslutas minst 24 timmar innan perioden slutar. Hantera eller avsluta när som helst i dina App Store-inställningar."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"El pago se carga en tu Apple ID. Las suscripciones se renuevan automáticamente salvo que se cancelen al menos 24 horas antes de que termine el periodo. Gestiónalas o cancélalas cuando quieras en los ajustes del App Store."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"お支払いはApple IDに請求されます。サブスクリプションは期間終了の24時間以上前に解約しない限り自動更新されます。App Storeの設定でいつでも管理または解約できます。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Payment is charged to your Apple ID. Subscriptions renew automatically unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the period ends. Manage or cancel anytime in your App Store settings."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O pagamento é cobrado no seu Apple ID. As assinaturas são renovadas automaticamente, a menos que sejam canceladas pelo menos 24 horas antes do fim do período. Gerencie ou cancele quando quiser nos ajustes da App Store."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"결제 금액은 Apple ID로 청구됩니다. 구독 기간이 끝나기 최소 24시간 전에 취소하지 않으면 구독이 자동으로 갱신됩니다. 언제든지 App Store 설정에서 관리하거나 취소할 수 있습니다."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Płatność zostanie pobrana z Twojego Apple ID. Subskrypcje odnawiają się automatycznie, chyba że zostaną anulowane co najmniej 24 godziny przed końcem okresu. Zarządzaj nimi lub anuluj w dowolnym momencie w ustawieniach App Store."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Il pagamento viene addebitato sul tuo ID Apple. Gli abbonamenti si rinnovano automaticamente se non vengono annullati almeno 24 ore prima della fine del periodo. Gestiscili o annullali quando vuoi nelle impostazioni dell'App Store."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"De betaling wordt in rekening gebracht via je Apple ID. Abonnementen worden automatisch verlengd, tenzij je ze minstens 24 uur voor het einde van de periode opzegt. Beheer of zeg op wanneer je wilt in je App Store-instellingen."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Betalingen trækkes på dit Apple-id. Abonnementer fornyes automatisk, medmindre de opsiges mindst 24 timer før periodens udløb. Administrer eller opsig når som helst i dine App Store-indstillinger."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Оплата списывается с вашего Apple ID. Подписка продлевается автоматически, если не отменить ее как минимум за 24 часа до конца периода. Управлять подпиской или отменить ее можно в любое время в настройках App Store."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Die Zahlung wird über deine Apple-ID abgerechnet. Abos verlängern sich automatisch, wenn sie nicht mindestens 24 Stunden vor Ablauf des Zeitraums gekündigt werden. Verwalten oder kündigen jederzeit in deinen App-Store-Einstellungen."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Betalingen belastes Apple-ID-en din. Abonnementer fornyes automatisk med mindre de avsluttes minst 24 timer før perioden slutter. Administrer eller avslutt når som helst i App Store-innstillingene."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Le paiement est débité sur votre identifiant Apple. Les abonnements se renouvellent automatiquement sauf résiliation au moins 24 heures avant la fin de la période. Gérez-les ou résiliez-les à tout moment dans les réglages de l'App Store."}}}},"hint_payment_is_charged_to_your_google":{"localizations":{"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"お支払いはGoogle Playアカウントに請求されます。サブスクリプションは解約しない限り自動更新されます。Playストアでいつでも管理または解約できます。"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Оплата списывается с вашего аккаунта Google Play. Подписка продлевается автоматически, пока ее не отменят. Управлять подпиской или отменить ее можно в любое время в Play Store."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Płatność zostanie pobrana z Twojego konta Google Play. Subskrypcje odnawiają się automatycznie, chyba że zostaną anulowane. Zarządzaj nimi lub anuluj w dowolnym momencie w Sklepie Play."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Betalingen belastes Google Play-kontoen din. Abonnementer fornyes automatisk med mindre de avsluttes. Administrer eller avslutt når som helst i Play Store."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Le paiement est débité sur votre compte Google Play. Les abonnements se renouvellent automatiquement sauf résiliation. Gérez-les ou résiliez-les à tout moment dans le Play Store."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"결제 금액은 Google Play 계정으로 청구됩니다. 취소하지 않으면 구독이 자동으로 갱신됩니다. 언제든지 Play 스토어에서 관리하거나 취소할 수 있습니다."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Il pagamento viene addebitato sul tuo account Google Play. Gli abbonamenti si rinnovano automaticamente se non vengono annullati. Gestiscili o annullali quando vuoi nel Play Store."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Die Zahlung wird über dein Google-Play-Konto abgerechnet. Abos verlängern sich automatisch, wenn sie nicht gekündigt werden. Verwalten oder kündigen jederzeit im Play Store."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O pagamento é cobrado na sua conta do Google Play. As assinaturas são renovadas automaticamente, a menos que sejam canceladas. Gerencie ou cancele quando quiser na Play Store."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Betalningen debiteras ditt Google Play-konto. Prenumerationer förnyas automatiskt om de inte avslutas. Hantera eller avsluta när som helst i Play Butik."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"De betaling wordt in rekening gebracht via je Google Play-account. Abonnementen worden automatisch verlengd, tenzij je ze opzegt. Beheer of zeg op wanneer je wilt in de Play Store."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Payment is charged to your Google Play account. Subscriptions renew automatically unless cancelled. Manage or cancel anytime in the Play Store."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Betalingen trækkes på din Google Play-konto. Abonnementer fornyes automatisk, medmindre de opsiges. Administrer eller opsig når som helst i Play Butik."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"El pago se carga en tu cuenta de Google Play. Las suscripciones se renuevan automáticamente salvo que se cancelen. Gestiónalas o cancélalas cuando quieras en Play Store."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"费用将从你的 Google Play 帐户扣除。除非取消，否则订阅将自动续订。可随时在 Play 商店中管理或取消。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"款項將從你的 Google Play 帳戶扣款。除非取消，否則訂閱會自動續訂。你可隨時在 Play 商店中管理或取消。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ödeme Google Play hesabından alınır. Abonelikler iptal edilmezse otomatik olarak yenilenir. Play Store'da istediğin zaman yönet veya iptal et."}}}},"hint_pick_accent_color_used_for":{"localizations":{"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Uygulama genelinde odak vurguları ve simgeler için kullanılan vurgu rengini seç."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Välj accentfärgen för fokusmarkeringar och symboler i hela appen."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"選擇整個 App 中焦點醒目提示和圖像所使用的強調色。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"选择用于整个 App 中焦点高亮和图标的强调色。"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Выберите цвет акцента для выделения фокуса и значков во всем приложении."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wybierz kolor akcentu używany do podświetleń fokusu i ikon w całej aplikacji."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scegli il colore di accento usato per l'evidenziazione del focus e le icone in tutta l'app."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"앱 전체에서 포커스 강조 표시와 아이콘에 사용할 강조 색상을 선택하세요."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elige el color de acento que se usa para resaltar el foco y los iconos en toda la app."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vælg den accentfarve, der bruges til fokusmarkeringer og ikoner i hele appen."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wähle die Akzentfarbe für Fokus-Hervorhebungen und Symbole in der ganzen App."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Velg aksentfargen som brukes for fokusmarkering og ikoner i hele appen."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Escolha a cor de destaque usada nos destaques de foco e ícones em todo o app."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Pick the accent color used for focus highlights and icons throughout the app."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Choisissez la couleur d'accentuation utilisée pour la mise en évidence et les icônes dans toute l'app."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kies de accentkleur voor focusmarkeringen en symbolen in de hele app."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"アプリ全体のフォーカスのハイライトとアイコンに使うアクセントカラーを選択します。"}}}},"hint_pick_app_theme_and_accent":{"localizations":{"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scegli il tema dell'app e il colore di accento usato per l'evidenziazione del focus e le icone in tutta l'app."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wybierz motyw aplikacji i kolor akcentu używany do podświetleń fokusu i ikon w całej aplikacji."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Выберите тему приложения и цвет акцента для выделения фокуса и значков во всем приложении."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"アプリのテーマと、アプリ全体のフォーカスのハイライトとアイコンに使うアクセントカラーを選択します。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Escolha o tema do app e a cor de destaque usada nos destaques de foco e ícones em todo o app."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Choisissez le thème de l'app et la couleur d'accentuation utilisée pour la mise en évidence et les icônes dans toute l'app."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elige el tema de la app y el color de acento que se usa para resaltar el foco y los iconos en toda la app."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vælg apptemaet og den accentfarve, der bruges til fokusmarkeringer og ikoner i hele appen."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Pick the app theme and the accent color used for focus highlights and icons throughout the app."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wähle das App-Design und die Akzentfarbe für Fokus-Hervorhebungen und Symbole in der ganzen App."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"앱 테마와 앱 전체에서 포커스 강조 표시와 아이콘에 사용할 강조 색상을 선택하세요."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Velg apptemaet og aksentfargen som brukes for fokusmarkering og ikoner i hele appen."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kies het thema van de app en de accentkleur voor focusmarkeringen en symbolen in de hele app."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Uygulama temasını ve uygulama genelinde odak vurguları ve simgeler için kullanılan vurgu rengini seç."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Välj apptema och accentfärgen för fokusmarkeringar och symboler i hela appen."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"选择 App 主题以及用于整个 App 中焦点高亮和图标的强调色。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"選擇 App 主題，以及整個 App 中焦點醒目提示和圖像所使用的強調色。"}}}},"hint_picked_on_this_device_from":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Utvalt på den här enheten utifrån dina uppspelningar, O-räknare och betyg."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oynatmalarından, O Sayılarından ve puanlarından bu aygıtta seçildi."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"根据你的播放、O 计数和评分在此设备上挑选。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"依據你的播放、O 計數和評分，在此裝置上挑選。"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"再生、Oカウント、評価をもとにこのデバイスで選ばれます。"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Valgt på denne enheten ut fra avspillinger, O-tellere og vurderinger."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Auf diesem Gerät aus deinen Wiedergaben, O-Zählern und Bewertungen ausgewählt."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Op dit apparaat gekozen uit je weergaven, O-tellers en beoordelingen."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Подобрано на этом устройстве по вашим воспроизведениям, O и рейтингам."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Udvalgt på denne enhed ud fra dine afspilninger, O-tællere og bedømmelser."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wybierane na tym urządzeniu na podstawie Twoich odtworzeń, liczników O i ocen."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Picked on this device from your plays, O Counts and ratings."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scelte su questo dispositivo in base a riproduzioni, contatori O e valutazioni."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Escolhidas neste dispositivo a partir das suas reproduções, contagens O e avaliações."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Seleccionado en este dispositivo a partir de tus reproducciones, contadores O y valoraciones."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"재생, O 카운트 및 별점을 바탕으로 이 기기에서 선택했습니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sélectionnées sur cet appareil à partir de vos lectures, compteurs O et notes."}}}},"hint_pick_performer_to_start_rise":{"localizations":{"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Scegli un performer per iniziare la partita Rise"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elige un intérprete para empezar la partida de Rise"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Escolha um artista para iniciar a rodada Rise"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kies een performer om de Rise-run te starten"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wybierz aktora, aby rozpocząć rundę Rise"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Выберите исполнителя, чтобы начать забег Rise"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wähle einen Darsteller, um den Rise-Lauf zu starten"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Pick a performer to start the Rise run"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vælg en kunstner for at starte Rise-runden"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Riseランを開始する出演者を選択"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Velg en utøver for å starte Rise-runden"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Choisissez un performeur pour lancer la partie Rise"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rise 진행을 시작할 배우를 선택하세요"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rise turunu başlatmak için bir oyuncu seç"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"選擇一位演員以開始 Rise 回合"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"选择一位演员开始 Rise 回合"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Välj en stjärna för att starta Rise-omgången"}}}},"hint_play_count_history_resume_point":{"localizations":{"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"伺服器上的播放次數、紀錄、續播位置和觀看時間。播放器選單可針對單一短片暫停記錄。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Antal visningar, historik, återupptagningspunkt och visningstid på servern. Spelarmenyn kan pausa det för en scen."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"服务器上的播放次数、历史记录、续播位置和观看时长。可通过播放器菜单对单个短片暂停记录。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sunucudaki oynatma sayısı, geçmiş, devam noktası ve izleme süresi. Oynatıcı menüsü bunu bir sahne için duraklatabilir."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Antall avspillinger, historikk, gjenopptakingspunkt og seertid på serveren. Spillermenyen kan sette det på pause for én scene."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nombre de lectures, historique, point de reprise et durée de visionnage sur le serveur. Le menu du lecteur permet de le suspendre pour une scène."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"서버의 재생 횟수, 기록, 이어서 재생 위치 및 시청 시간입니다. 플레이어 메뉴에서 영상 하나에 대해 일시 중지할 수 있습니다."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Contagem de reproduções, histórico, ponto de retomada e tempo assistido no servidor. O menu do player pode pausar isso para uma cena."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Número de reproducciones, historial, punto de reanudación y tiempo de reproducción en el servidor. El menú del reproductor puede pausarlo para una escena."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Afspeelaantal, geschiedenis, hervatpunt en kijktijd op de server. Het spelermenu kan dit voor één scène pauzeren."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Numero di riproduzioni, cronologia, punto di ripresa e tempo di visione sul server. Il menu del player può sospenderli per una scena."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"再生回数、履歴、再開位置、再生時間をサーバーに記録します。プレーヤーメニューで1つのシーンだけ一時停止できます。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wiedergaben, Verlauf, Fortsetzungspunkt und Wiedergabezeit auf dem Server. Im Player-Menü lässt es sich für eine Szene pausieren."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Число воспроизведений, история, точка продолжения и время просмотра на сервере. В меню плеера это можно приостановить для одной сцены."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Play count, history, resume point and watch time on the server. The player menu can pause it for one scene."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Liczba odtworzeń, historia, punkt wznowienia i czas oglądania na serwerze. Menu odtwarzacza może to wstrzymać dla jednej sceny."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Antal afspilninger, historik, genoptagelsespunkt og afspilningstid på serveren. Afspillermenuen kan sætte det på pause for én scene."}}}},"hint_plays_scenes_back_to_back":{"localizations":{"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Reproduce escenas una tras otra desde una fila de Inicio: estrenadas recientemente, añadidas recientemente o tus filtros de escenas guardados. Las páginas de intérpretes, estudios, etiquetas y grupos tienen su propio canal."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Afspiller scener efter hinanden fra en række på Hjem: senest udgivet, senest tilføjet eller dine gemte scenefiltre. Sider for kunstnere, studier, tags og grupper får deres egen kanal."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Speelt scènes achter elkaar af uit een rij op Home: recent uitgebracht, recent toegevoegd of je bewaarde scènefilters. Pagina's van performers, studio's, labels en groepen krijgen hun eigen kanaal."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Spielt Szenen nacheinander aus einer Zeile auf Start: kürzlich erschienen, kürzlich hinzugefügt oder deine gespeicherten Szenenfilter. Darsteller-, Studio-, Tag- und Gruppenseiten haben einen eigenen Kanal."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Riproduce scene una dopo l'altra da una riga della Home: uscite di recente, aggiunte di recente o i tuoi filtri scene salvati. Le pagine di performer, studi, tag e gruppi hanno il loro canale."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Reproduz cenas em sequência a partir de uma linha do Início: lançadas recentemente, adicionadas recentemente ou seus filtros salvos de cenas. Páginas de artistas, estúdios, etiquetas e grupos têm seu próprio canal."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Plays scenes back to back from a row on Home: recently released, recently added or your saved scene filters. Performer, studio, tag and group pages get their own channel."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Odtwarza sceny jedna po drugiej z wiersza ekranu Start: ostatnio wydane, ostatnio dodane lub Twoje zapisane filtry scen. Strony aktorów, studiów, tagów i grup mają własny kanał."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Spiller scener etter hverandre fra en rad på Hjem: nylig utgitt, nylig lagt til eller de lagrede scenefiltrene dine. Utøver-, studio-, tagg- og gruppesider får sin egen kanal."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ホームの行からシーンを連続再生します：最近リリース、最近追加、または保存済みシーンフィルター。出演者、スタジオ、タグ、グループのページにはそれぞれ専用のチャンネルがあります。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lit les scènes à la suite depuis une rangée de l'accueil : sorties récentes, ajouts récents ou vos filtres de scènes enregistrés. Les pages de performeur, studio, étiquette et groupe ont leur propre chaîne."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"홈의 행(최근 공개, 최근 추가 또는 저장된 영상 필터)에서 영상을 연속으로 재생합니다. 배우, 스튜디오, 태그 및 그룹 페이지에는 자체 채널이 있습니다."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Воспроизводит подряд сцены из ряда главной: недавно вышедшие, недавно добавленные или ваши сохраненные фильтры сцен. У страниц исполнителей, студий, тегов и групп — свой канал."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ana Sayfa'daki bir satırdan sahneleri art arda oynatır: son çıkanlar, son eklenenler veya kayıtlı sahne filtrelerin. Oyuncu, stüdyo, etiket ve grup sayfalarının kendi kanalı olur."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Spelar scener i följd från en rad på Hem: nyligen släppta, nyligen tillagda eller dina sparade scenfilter. Sidor för stjärnor, studior, taggar och grupper får en egen kanal."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"從首頁的某一列連續播放短片：最近發行、最近加入或你已儲存的短片篩選條件。演員、工作室、標籤和群組頁面也有各自的頻道。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"连续播放主页某一行中的短片：最近发行、最近添加或你的已存短片过滤器。演员、工作室、标签和集合页面有各自的频道。"}}}},"hint_please_configure_your_stash_server":{"localizations":{"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"請設定你的 Stash 伺服器以開始使用。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Başlamak için Stash sunucunu yapılandır."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"请配置你的 Stash 服务器以开始使用。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Konfigurera din Stash-server för att komma igång."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Skonfiguruj serwer Stash, aby rozpocząć."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Richte deinen Stash-Server ein, um loszulegen."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Please configure your Stash server to get started."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"시작하려면 Stash 서버를 구성하세요."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Для начала настройте сервер Stash."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"始めるにはStashサーバーを設定してください。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Configurez votre serveur Stash pour commencer."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Configura il tuo server Stash per iniziare."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Konfigurer Stash-serveren din for å komme i gang."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stel je Stash-server in om te beginnen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Configura tu servidor Stash para empezar."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Configure seu servidor Stash para começar."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Konfigurer din Stash-server for at komme i gang."}}}},"hint_please_enable_dashboard_performers_studios":{"localizations":{"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Activa Dashboard, Intérpretes, Estudios, Etiquetas, Grupos o Marcadores en Ajustes"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Schakel Dashboard, Performers, Studio's, Labels, Groepen of Markeringen in bij Instellingen"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Включите в настройках Dashboard, исполнителей, студии, теги, группы или маркеры"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Activez Dashboard, Performeurs, Studios, Étiquettes, Groupes ou Marqueurs dans les réglages"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ative Dashboard, Artistas, Estúdios, Etiquetas, Grupos ou Marcadores em Ajustes"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aktiviere Dashboard, Darsteller, Studios, Tags, Gruppen oder Marker in den Einstellungen"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Włącz w Ustawieniach Dashboard, Aktorów, Studia, Tagi, Grupy lub Znaczniki"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"設定でDashboard、出演者、スタジオ、タグ、グループ、マーカーのいずれかを有効にしてください"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"설정에서 Dashboard, 배우, 스튜디오, 태그, 그룹 또는 마커를 활성화하세요"}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Slå på Dashboard, Utøvere, Studioer, Tagger, Grupper eller Markører i Innstillinger"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Slå Dashboard, Kunstnere, Studier, Tags, Grupper eller Markører til i Indstillinger"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Attiva Dashboard, Performer, Studi, Tag, Gruppi o Marcatori in Impostazioni"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Please enable Dashboard, Performers, Studios, Tags, Groups or Markers in Settings"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aktivera Dashboard, Stjärnor, Studior, Taggar, Grupper eller Markörer i Inställningar"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"請在「設定」中啟用 Dashboard、演員、工作室、標籤、群組或標記"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ayarlar'da Dashboard, Oyuncular, Stüdyolar, Etiketler, Gruplar veya İşaretçiler'i aç"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"请在设置中启用 Dashboard、演员、工作室、标签、集合或标记"}}}},"hint_premium_features_including_channels_continuous":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Premiumfunktioner, bland annat Kanaler – kontinuerlig uppspelning av en stjärna, studio, tagg eller ett sparat filter."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"高级功能，包括频道 — 连续播放某位演员、工作室、标签或已存过滤器的内容。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kanallar dahil premium özellikler — bir oyuncu, stüdyo, etiket veya kayıtlı filtrenin kesintisiz oynatılması."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"進階功能，包括頻道 — 連續播放某位演員、工作室、標籤或已儲存篩選條件的內容。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Premium features, including Channels — continuous playback of a performer, studio, tag or saved filter."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Funkcje premium, w tym kanały — ciągłe odtwarzanie aktora, studia, tagu lub zapisanego filtra."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Премиум-функции, включая каналы — непрерывное воспроизведение исполнителя, студии, тега или сохраненного фильтра."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fonctions premium, dont les chaînes — lecture continue d'un performeur, studio, étiquette ou filtre enregistré."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Premiumfunksjoner, inkludert kanaler – kontinuerlig avspilling av en utøver, et studio, en tagg eller et lagret filter."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"チャンネル（出演者、スタジオ、タグ、保存済みフィルターの連続再生）などのプレミアム機能。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Premiumfuncties, waaronder Kanalen – doorlopend afspelen van een performer, studio, label of bewaard filter."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Recursos premium, incluindo Canais — reprodução contínua de um artista, estúdio, etiqueta ou filtro salvo."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Funciones premium, como Canales: reproducción continua de un intérprete, estudio, etiqueta o filtro guardado."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Premiumfunktioner, herunder Kanaler – fortløbende afspilning af en kunstner, et studie, et tag eller et gemt filter."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"채널(배우, 스튜디오, 태그 또는 저장된 필터의 연속 재생)을 포함한 프리미엄 기능."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Premium-Funktionen, darunter Kanäle – fortlaufende Wiedergabe eines Darstellers, Studios, Tags oder gespeicherten Filters."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Funzioni premium, inclusi i Canali: riproduzione continua di un performer, studio, tag o filtro salvato."}}}},"hint_purchase_pending_it_unlocks_once":{"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Purchase pending — it unlocks once payment completes."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Achat en attente — le déblocage a lieu une fois le paiement effectué."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Købet afventer – det låses op, når betalingen er gennemført."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"구입 대기 중 — 결제가 완료되면 잠금 해제됩니다."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kjøpet venter – det låses opp når betalingen er fullført."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Compra pendente — será desbloqueado quando o pagamento for concluído."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kauf ausstehend – wird freigeschaltet, sobald die Zahlung abgeschlossen ist."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zakup oczekuje — zostanie odblokowany po zakończeniu płatności."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aankoop in behandeling – wordt ontgrendeld zodra de betaling is voltooid."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"購入は保留中です — 支払いが完了するとロック解除されます。"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Acquisto in sospeso: verrà sbloccato al completamento del pagamento."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Compra pendiente: se desbloqueará cuando se complete el pago."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Покупка ожидает — доступ откроется после оплаты."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"购买待处理 — 付款完成后即可解锁。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Köpet väntar – det låses upp när betalningen är klar."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"購買處理中 — 付款完成後即會解鎖。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Satın alma bekliyor — ödeme tamamlanınca kilidi açılır."}}}},"hint_puts_performers_against_each_other":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ställer stjärnor mot varandra i Verktyg. Du väljer vinnaren och deras betyg uppdateras på servern."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Araçlar'da oyuncuları karşı karşıya getirir. Kazananı sen seçersin ve puanları sunucunda güncellenir."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在“工具”中让演员两两对决。你选出胜者，其评分会在你的服务器上更新。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在「工具」中讓演員互相對決。由你選出勝者，其評分會在你的伺服器上更新。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Coloca artistas uns contra os outros em Ferramentas. Você escolhe o vencedor e as avaliações deles são atualizadas no seu servidor."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Сталкивает исполнителей друг с другом в «Инструментах». Вы выбираете победителя, а их рейтинги обновляются на сервере."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zet performers tegen elkaar op in Tools. Jij kiest de winnaar en hun beoordelingen worden op je server bijgewerkt."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"도구에서 배우끼리 대결시킵니다. 승자를 고르면 서버의 별점이 업데이트됩니다."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Setter utøvere opp mot hverandre i Verktøy. Du velger vinneren, og vurderingene oppdateres på serveren."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Puts performers against each other in Tools. You pick the winner and their ratings update on your server."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lässt in Werkzeuge Darsteller gegeneinander antreten. Du wählst den Gewinner, und ihre Bewertungen werden auf deinem Server aktualisiert."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sætter kunstnere op mod hinanden i Værktøjer. Du vælger vinderen, og deres bedømmelser opdateres på din server."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ツールで出演者同士を対戦させます。勝者を選ぶと、サーバー上の評価が更新されます。"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mette i performer uno contro l'altro in Strumenti. Scegli tu il vincitore e le loro valutazioni vengono aggiornate sul server."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oppose des performeurs les uns aux autres dans Outils. Vous choisissez le gagnant et leurs notes sont mises à jour sur votre serveur."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Enfrenta a intérpretes entre sí en Herramientas. Tú eliges al ganador y sus valoraciones se actualizan en tu servidor."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zestawia aktorów ze sobą w Narzędziach. Wybierasz zwycięzcę, a ich oceny aktualizują się na serwerze."}}}},"hint_puts_performers_against_each_other_under":{"localizations":{"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Mette i performer uno contro l'altro in Scopri. Scegli tu il vincitore e le loro valutazioni vengono aggiornate sul server."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zestawia aktorów ze sobą w sekcji Odkrywaj. Wybierasz zwycięzcę, a ich oceny aktualizują się na serwerze."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Сталкивает исполнителей друг с другом в разделе «Открытия». Вы выбираете победителя, а их рейтинги обновляются на сервере."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Enfrenta a intérpretes entre sí en Descubrir. Tú eliges al ganador y sus valoraciones se actualizan en tu servidor."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Coloca artistas uns contra os outros em Descobrir. Você escolhe o vencedor e as avaliações deles são atualizadas no seu servidor."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Sætter kunstnere op mod hinanden under Opdag. Du vælger vinderen, og deres bedømmelser opdateres på din server."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Zet performers tegen elkaar op onder Ontdek. Jij kiest de winnaar en hun beoordelingen worden op je server bijgewerkt."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"「見つける」で出演者同士を対戦させます。勝者を選ぶと、サーバー上の評価が更新されます。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oppose des performeurs les uns aux autres dans Découvrir. Vous choisissez le gagnant et leurs notes sont mises à jour sur votre serveur."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"둘러보기에서 배우끼리 대결시킵니다. 승자를 고르면 서버의 별점이 업데이트됩니다."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Puts performers against each other under Discover. You pick the winner and their ratings update on your server."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Setter utøvere opp mot hverandre under Utforsk. Du velger vinneren, og vurderingene oppdateres på serveren."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lässt unter Entdecken Darsteller gegeneinander antreten. Du wählst den Gewinner, und ihre Bewertungen werden auf deinem Server aktualisiert."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在“发现”中让演员两两对决。你选出胜者，其评分会在你的服务器上更新。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在「探索」中讓演員互相對決。由你選出勝者，其評分會在你的伺服器上更新。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ställer stjärnor mot varandra under Upptäck. Du väljer vinnaren och deras betyg uppdateras på servern."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Keşfet altında oyuncuları karşı karşıya getirir. Kazananı sen seçersin ve puanları sunucunda güncellenir."}}}},"hint_ranks_your_top_scenes_performers":{"localizations":{"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在「工具」中依 O 計數或評分等指標，為你最常看的短片、演員、工作室和標籤排名。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rangordnar dina främsta scener, stjärnor, studior och taggar i Verktyg, efter mått som O-räknare eller betyg."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Araçlar'da en iyi sahnelerini, oyuncularını, stüdyolarını ve etiketlerini O Sayısı veya puan gibi ölçülere göre sıralar."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"在“工具”中按 O 计数或评分等指标为你的热门短片、演员、工作室和标签排名。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Classe vos meilleurs scènes, performeurs, studios et étiquettes dans Outils, selon des critères comme le compteur O ou la note."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oカウントや評価などの指標で、トップのシーン、出演者、スタジオ、タグをツールでランキング表示します。"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Составляет в «Инструментах» рейтинги ваших лучших сцен, исполнителей, студий и тегов — по счетчику O, рейтингу и другим показателям."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rangschikt je topscènes, -performers, -studio's en -labels in Tools, op maatstaven zoals O-teller of beoordeling."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tworzy w Narzędziach rankingi Twoich najlepszych scen, aktorów, studiów i tagów według miar takich jak licznik O czy ocena."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Classifica le tue scene, performer, studi e tag migliori in Strumenti, per criteri come contatore O o valutazione."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Classifica suas principais cenas, artistas, estúdios e etiquetas em Ferramentas, por critérios como contagem O ou avaliação."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rangerer de beste scenene, utøverne, studioene og taggene dine i Verktøy, etter mål som O-teller eller vurdering."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ranks your top scenes, performers, studios and tags in Tools, by measures like O Count or rating."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rangerer dine topscener, -kunstnere, -studier og -tags i Værktøjer efter mål som O-tæller eller bedømmelse."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"도구에서 O 카운트나 별점 등의 기준으로 상위 영상, 배우, 스튜디오 및 태그의 순위를 매깁니다."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rankt deine Top-Szenen, -Darsteller, -Studios und -Tags in Werkzeuge, nach Maßen wie O-Zähler oder Bewertung."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Clasifica tus escenas, intérpretes, estudios y etiquetas favoritos en Herramientas según medidas como el contador O o la valoración."}}}},"hint_ratings_that_were_not_saved":{"localizations":{"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Несохраненные рейтинги будут потеряны."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Vurderinger som ikke ble lagret, går tapt."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Les notes non enregistrées sont perdues."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Avaliações que não foram salvas serão perdidas."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Nicht gespeicherte Bewertungen gehen verloren."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Beoordelingen die niet zijn bewaard, gaan verloren."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"保存されていない評価は失われます。"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Las valoraciones que no se guardaron se pierden."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ratings that were not saved are lost."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Le valutazioni non salvate andranno perse."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Niezapisane oceny zostaną utracone."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"저장되지 않은 별점은 사라집니다."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bedømmelser, der ikke blev gemt, går tabt."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Betyg som inte sparades går förlorade."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"未存储的评分将会丢失。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"未儲存的評分將會遺失。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Kaydedilmeyen puanlar kaybolur."}}}},"hint_remove_arg_from_stash_other":{"localizations":{"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"要從 Stash 移除「%@」嗎？其他裝置將失去此已儲存的篩選條件。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ta bort ”%@” från Stash? Andra enheter förlorar det här sparade filtret."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"“%@” Stash'ten kaldırılsın mı? Diğer aygıtlar bu kayıtlı filtreyi kaybeder."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"要从 Stash 中移除“%@”吗？其他设备将失去此已存过滤器。"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Retirer « %@ » de Stash ? Les autres appareils perdront ce filtre enregistré."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"'%@' uit Stash verwijderen? Andere apparaten verliezen dit bewaarde filter."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerne «%@» fra Stash? Andre enheter mister dette lagrede filteret."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stash에서 “%@”을(를) 제거하겠습니까? 다른 기기에서도 이 저장된 필터가 사라집니다."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"¿Quitar «%@» de Stash? Los demás dispositivos perderán este filtro guardado."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Remove “%@” from Stash? Other devices will lose this saved filter."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Удалить «%@» из Stash? На других устройствах этот сохраненный фильтр тоже пропадет."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rimuovere “%@” da Stash? Gli altri dispositivi perderanno questo filtro salvato."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"„%@“ aus Stash entfernen? Andere Geräte verlieren diesen gespeicherten Filter."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Usunąć „%@” ze Stash? Inne urządzenia stracą ten zapisany filtr."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjern “%@” fra Stash? Andre enheder mister dette gemte filter."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Remover “%@” do Stash? Outros dispositivos perderão este filtro salvo."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"「%@」をStashから削除しますか？他のデバイスでもこの保存済みフィルターが使えなくなります。"}}}},"hint_remove_arg_from_this_device":{"localizations":{"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"¿Quitar «%@» de este dispositivo? Esta acción no se puede deshacer."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"'%@' van dit apparaat verwijderen? Dit kan niet ongedaan worden gemaakt."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Remover “%@” deste dispositivo? Não é possível desfazer."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Удалить «%@» с этого устройства? Это действие нельзя отменить."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjern “%@” fra denne enhed? Det kan ikke fortrydes."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Retirer « %@ » de cet appareil ? Cette action est irréversible."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"„%@“ von diesem Gerät entfernen? Das kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerne «%@» fra denne enheten? Dette kan ikke angres."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"「%@」をこのデバイスから削除しますか？この操作は取り消せません。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 기기에서 “%@”을(를) 제거하겠습니까? 이 작업은 실행 취소할 수 없습니다."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Usunąć „%@” z tego urządzenia? Tej operacji nie można cofnąć."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rimuovere “%@” da questo dispositivo? Questa azione non può essere annullata."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Remove “%@” from this device? This cannot be undone."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"要從此裝置移除「%@」嗎？此動作無法還原。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ta bort ”%@” från den här enheten? Det går inte att ångra."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"要从此设备中移除“%@”吗？此操作无法撤销。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"“%@” bu aygıttan kaldırılsın mı? Bu işlem geri alınamaz."}}}},"hint_removes_arg_from_dashboard_saved":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"从 Dashboard 中移除“%@”。已存过滤器本身仍保留在服务器上。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"“%@” Dashboard'dan kaldırılır. Kayıtlı filtrenin kendisi sunucuda kalır."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tar bort ”%@” från Dashboard. Själva det sparade filtret finns kvar på servern."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"從 Dashboard 移除「%@」。已儲存的篩選條件本身仍會保留在伺服器上。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Remove \"%@\" do Dashboard. O filtro salvo em si continua no servidor."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Entfernt „%@“ aus dem Dashboard. Der gespeicherte Filter selbst bleibt auf dem Server."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Retire « %@ » du Dashboard. Le filtre enregistré reste sur le serveur."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rimuove \"%@\" dalla dashboard. Il filtro salvato resta sul server."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerner \"%@\" fra Dashboard. Selve det gemte filter bliver på serveren."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerner «%@» fra Dashboard. Selve det lagrede filteret blir værende på serveren."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dashboard에서 \"%@\"을(를) 제거합니다. 저장된 필터 자체는 서버에 남아 있습니다."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Quita «%@» del Dashboard. El filtro guardado sigue en el servidor."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Removes \"%@\" from the dashboard. The saved filter itself stays on the server."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"「%@」をDashboardから削除します。保存済みフィルター自体はサーバーに残ります。"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Verwijdert '%@' van het dashboard. Het bewaarde filter zelf blijft op de server."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Usuwa „%@” z Dashboardu. Sam zapisany filtr pozostaje na serwerze."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Убирает «%@» с Dashboard. Сам сохраненный фильтр остается на сервере."}}}},"hint_removes_cached_artwork_for_active":{"localizations":{"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Supprime les illustrations en cache du serveur actif. Les images sont retéléchargées lorsqu'elles apparaissent."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rimuove le immagini in cache del server attivo. Le immagini vengono riscaricate quando appaiono."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tar bort cachade bilder för den aktiva servern. Bilderna laddas ner igen när de visas."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerner de cachelagrede billeder for den aktive server. Billederne downloades igen, når de vises."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Usuwa zapisane grafiki aktywnego serwera. Obrazy zostaną ponownie pobrane, gdy się pojawią."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"使用中のサーバーのキャッシュ画像を削除します。画像は表示されるときに再ダウンロードされます。"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elimina las imágenes en caché del servidor activo. Se vuelven a descargar cuando aparecen."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Removes the cached artwork for the active server. Images are downloaded again as they appear."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Entfernt die zwischengespeicherten Bilder des aktiven Servers. Bilder werden beim Anzeigen neu geladen."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Удаляет кэш изображений активного сервера. Изображения будут загружены снова при появлении."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"활성 서버의 캐시된 아트워크를 제거합니다. 이미지는 표시될 때 다시 다운로드됩니다."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Remove as imagens em cache do servidor ativo. As imagens são baixadas novamente quando aparecerem."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Verwijdert de bewaarde illustraties voor de actieve server. Afbeeldingen worden opnieuw gedownload zodra ze verschijnen."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerner de bufrede bildene for den aktive serveren. Bildene lastes ned på nytt når de vises."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"移除当前服务器的缓存图片。图片再次出现时会重新下载。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"移除使用中伺服器的快取插圖。圖片會在顯示時重新下載。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Etkin sunucunun önbelleğe alınmış görsellerini kaldırır. Resimler göründükçe yeniden indirilir."}}}},"hint_removes_downloaded_speech_models_and":{"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"移除已下载的语音模型和翻译包。AI 字幕会在需要时重新下载它们。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"移除已下載的語音模型和翻譯套件。AI 字幕會在需要時重新下載。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"İndirilen konuşma modellerini ve çeviri paketlerini kaldırır. AI altyazılar gerektiğinde bunları yeniden indirir."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerner nedlastede talemodeller og oversettelsespakker. AI-undertekster laster dem ned igjen ved behov."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Verwijdert de gedownloade spraakmodellen en vertaalpakketten. AI-ondertiteling downloadt ze opnieuw wanneer nodig."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Entfernt die geladenen Sprachmodelle und Übersetzungspakete. KI-Untertitel laden sie bei Bedarf erneut."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"다운로드한 음성 모델과 번역 팩을 제거합니다. AI 자막이 필요할 때 다시 다운로드합니다."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elimina los modelos de voz y los paquetes de traducción descargados. Los subtítulos con IA los vuelven a descargar cuando hace falta."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Usuwa pobrane modele mowy i pakiety tłumaczeń. Napisy AI pobiorą je ponownie w razie potrzeby."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerner de downloadede talemodeller og oversættelsespakker. AI-undertekster downloader dem igen efter behov."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Supprime les modèles vocaux et packs de traduction téléchargés. Les sous-titres IA les retéléchargent au besoin."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rimuove i modelli vocali e i pacchetti di traduzione scaricati. I sottotitoli IA li riscaricano quando servono."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Remove os modelos de fala e pacotes de tradução baixados. As legendas por IA os baixam novamente quando necessário."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Удаляет загруженные речевые модели и пакеты перевода. ИИ-субтитры загрузят их снова при необходимости."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ダウンロード済みの音声モデルと翻訳パックを削除します。AI字幕は必要に応じて再ダウンロードします。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tar bort nedladdade talmodeller och översättningspaket. AI-undertexter laddar ner dem igen vid behov."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Removes the downloaded speech models and translation packs. AI subtitles download them again when needed."}}}},"hint_removes_scenes_images_and_galleries":{"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Removes scenes, images and galleries whose files no longer exist, with their generated files. This cannot be undone. A dry run only writes to the server log."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Usuwa sceny, obrazy i galerie, których pliki już nie istnieją, wraz z wygenerowanymi plikami. Tej operacji nie można cofnąć. Próba na sucho zapisuje tylko w dzienniku serwera."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerner scener, bilder og gallerier der filene ikke lenger finnes, sammen med de genererte filene. Dette kan ikke angres. En prøvekjøring skriver bare til serverloggen."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Entfernt Szenen, Bilder und Galerien, deren Dateien nicht mehr existieren, samt ihren generierten Dateien. Das kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden. Ein Probelauf schreibt nur ins Server-Log."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Remove cenas, imagens e galerias cujos arquivos não existem mais, junto com seus arquivos gerados. Não é possível desfazer. Uma simulação apenas escreve no log do servidor."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerner scener, billeder og gallerier, hvis filer ikke længere findes, sammen med deres genererede filer. Det kan ikke fortrydes. En prøvekørsel skriver kun til serverloggen."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"파일이 더 이상 존재하지 않는 영상, 이미지 및 갤러리를 생성된 파일과 함께 제거합니다. 이 작업은 실행 취소할 수 없습니다. 테스트 실행은 서버 로그에만 기록합니다."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Удаляет сцены, изображения и галереи, файлов которых больше нет, вместе с их сгенерированными файлами. Это действие нельзя отменить. Пробный запуск только пишет в журнал сервера."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Verwijdert scènes, afbeeldingen en galerijen waarvan de bestanden niet meer bestaan, met hun gegenereerde bestanden. Dit kan niet ongedaan worden gemaakt. Een proefrun schrijft alleen naar het serverlogboek."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Supprime les scènes, images et galeries dont les fichiers n'existent plus, ainsi que leurs fichiers générés. Cette action est irréversible. Une simulation écrit seulement dans le journal du serveur."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rimuove scene, immagini e gallerie i cui file non esistono più, insieme ai file generati. Questa azione non può essere annullata. Una simulazione scrive solo nel log del server."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Elimina escenas, imágenes y galerías cuyos archivos ya no existen, junto con sus archivos generados. Esta acción no se puede deshacer. Una simulación solo escribe en el registro del servidor."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ファイルが存在しなくなったシーン、画像、ギャラリーを、生成されたファイルとともに削除します。この操作は取り消せません。ドライランではサーバーログへの書き込みのみ行います。"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dosyaları artık bulunmayan sahneleri, resimleri ve galerileri, oluşturulan dosyalarıyla birlikte kaldırır. Bu işlem geri alınamaz. Deneme çalıştırması yalnızca sunucu günlüğüne yazar."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"移除檔案已不存在的短片、圖片和圖庫，以及其產生的檔案。此動作無法還原。試執行只會寫入伺服器日誌。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"移除文件已不存在的短片、图片和图库及其生成的文件。此操作无法撤销。试运行只会写入服务器日志。"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tar bort scener, bilder och gallerier vars filer inte längre finns, tillsammans med deras genererade filer. Det går inte att ångra. En testkörning skriver bara till serverloggen."}}}},"hint_remove_this_filter_this_cannot":{"localizations":{"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ta bort det här filtret? Det går inte att ångra."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bu filtre kaldırılsın mı? Bu işlem geri alınamaz."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"要移除此篩選條件嗎？此動作無法還原。"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"要移除此过滤器吗？此操作无法撤销。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 필터를 제거하겠습니까? 이 작업은 실행 취소할 수 없습니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Retirer ce filtre ? Cette action est irréversible."}},"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjerne dette filteret? Dette kan ikke angres."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"このフィルターを削除しますか？この操作は取り消せません。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Remover este filtro? Não é possível desfazer."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"¿Quitar este filtro? Esta acción no se puede deshacer."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Diesen Filter entfernen? Das kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rimuovere questo filtro? Questa azione non può essere annullata."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dit filter verwijderen? Dit kan niet ongedaan worden gemaakt."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Remove this filter? This cannot be undone."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Usunąć ten filtr? Tej operacji nie można cofnąć."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Fjern dette filter? Det kan ikke fortrydes."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Удалить этот фильтр? Это действие нельзя отменить."}}}},"hint_renames_selected_stash_saved_filter":{"localizations":{"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Renombra el filtro guardado de Stash o el filtro del dispositivo seleccionado."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Rinomina il filtro salvato di Stash o il filtro sul dispositivo selezionato."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Wijzigt de naam van het geselecteerde bewaarde Stash-filter of apparaatfil