e."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy łączy się z Intiface Desktop lub Intiface Central przez WebSockets. Upewnij się, że w ustawieniach Intiface włączono „Enable Remote Network Access”."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy se connecte à Intiface Desktop ou Intiface Central via WebSockets. Vérifiez que « Enable Remote Network Access » est activé dans les réglages d'Intiface."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashy forbinder til Intiface Desktop eller Intiface Central via WebSockets. Sørg for, at 'Enable Remote Network Access' er slået til i Intiface-indstillingerne."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy maakt via WebSockets verbinding met Intiface Desktop of Intiface Central. Zorg dat 'Enable Remote Network Access' is ingeschakeld in de instellingen van Intiface."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy verbindet sich per WebSockets mit Intiface Desktop oder Intiface Central. Stelle sicher, dass „Enable Remote Network Access“ in den Intiface-Einstellungen aktiv ist."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashyはWebSocketでIntiface DesktopまたはIntiface Centralに接続します。Intifaceの設定で「Enable Remote Network Access」がオンになっていることを確認してください。"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy se conecta a Intiface Desktop o Intiface Central mediante WebSockets. Asegúrate de que «Enable Remote Network Access» esté activado en los ajustes de Intiface."}}}},"hint_stashy_now_automatically_uploads_local":{"localizations":{"nb":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Stashy laster nå automatisk opp lokale funscripts til Handy Cloud. Den offentlige URL-en trengs bare for avanserte oppsett."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O stashy agora envia automaticamente funscripts locais para a Handy Cloud. A URL pública só é necessária em configurações avançadas."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"stashy en